# Analysis API and worker

Read `HANDOFF.md` §3, §8, §14 and [`investment-framework.mdc`](investment-framework.mdc) before implementing.

## Layout

```
apps/analysis-api/src/analysis_api/
  api/routes/     # HTTP only
  domain/         # risk/CAGR guard, quota, refine classifier
  schemas/        # Pydantic DTOs
apps/analysis-worker/src/analysis_worker/
  jobs/           # Step 0 gather, framework run, PDF render
```

## HTTP (mock contract)

```
POST /auth/signup · /auth/login · /auth/reset     # prefer Supabase Auth; do not duplicate unless locked
POST /portfolio/import   multipart CSV → parsed + rejected rows
POST /analysis           422 on risk/CAGR conflict or ticker not in holdings; returns job id
GET  /analysis/:id       status then report payload
POST /reports/:id/refine-gate  cheap model; billed kind=refine_gate
POST /reports/:id/refine billed; enrichment text in variable pack; classify prompt-extraction before dispatch
GET  /reports · PATCH /reports/:id · GET /reports/:id/pdf
GET  /usage · POST /billing/subscribe · /billing/wallet/topup
GET  /admin/accounts · PUT /admin/plans · POST /admin/prompt-versions
```

Admin HTTP is reached only after `/admin/login` (Next middleware + `users.role`). `platform_admin` must **not** be able to `POST /analysis`. Auth for the desk is Supabase Auth + Next.js — do not implement a second password store.

## Job lifecycle

`queued → gathering → drafting → checking → rendering → ready | failed`

A frontier run is **40–90s**. The UI may leave the page; the note appears under Reports.

## Layer rules

1. Routes parse/auth/enqueue only.
2. Domain owns 422 conflict, quota, refusal classifier, immutability.
3. Worker owns native-lab I/O (D39) and PDF. Worker uses `service_role` / direct Postgres; UI uses JWT + RLS. Completions go to OpenAI / Anthropic / xAI / DeepSeek with `provider_model_id`. Missing key for that provider fails the job.

Port **8091** locally (8090 reserved if this machine also runs invoice-processing validation-api).
